<title>SPAIN: Spain's MEFF opens late due to technical reasons.</title>
<headline>Spain's MEFF opens late due to technical reasons.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish MEFF for interest-rate derivatives opened on Wednesday at around 0735 GMT instead at 0700 GMT due to technical problems, dealers said.</p>
<p>The long term futures contract opened at 115.75, or 15 basis points down from Tuesday's closing level.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
